<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" ><generator uri="https://jekyllrb.com/" version="4.3.2">Jekyll</generator><link href="https://acm.cs.nycu.edu.tw/feed.xml" rel="self" type="application/atom+xml" /><link href="https://acm.cs.nycu.edu.tw/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" /><updated>2026-10-16T09:35:05+00:00</updated><id>https://acm.cs.nycu.edu.tw/feed.xml</id><title type="html">Applied Computing and Multimedia Lab</title><subtitle>ACM Lab - National Yang Ming Chiao Tung University</subtitle><entry><title type="html">Our lab at ICIP 2026</title><link href="https://acm.cs.nycu.edu.tw/2026/10/16/ICIP-Conference.html" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Our lab at ICIP 2026" /><published>2026-10-16T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2026-10-16T09:32:39+00:00</updated><id>https://acm.cs.nycu.edu.tw/2026/10/16/ICIP-Conference</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://acm.cs.nycu.edu.tw/2026/10/16/ICIP-Conference.html"><![CDATA[<p>📸✨ We are proud to share that our research team has five papers at the <strong>IEEE International Conference on Image Processing (ICIP) 2026</strong>, showcasing our latest research in image processing, video editing, remote sensing, and 3D vision!</p>

<p>Our featured works include:</p>

<ol>
  <li><a href="https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/11630121">ADAPT: Any-codec Diffusion-based Adaptation for Image Perception-Distortion Tradeoff</a></li>
  <li><a href="https://arxiv.org/html/2606.22042v1">IDAG-Edit: Multi-Object Video Editing via Instance-Decoupled Attention and Guidance</a></li>
  <li><a href="https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/11630128">PaTSeg: A Patch-Level Text Supervision Paradigm for Mask-Free Remote Sensing Segmentation</a></li>
  <li><a href="https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/11630578">TEXT-PILOT: Intelligent Visual Text Planning and Manipulation via Multi-Modal LLM as Agent</a></li>
  <li><a href="https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/11629888">Multi-Light Relightable Gaussian Splatting with Phong Reflectance from in-the-wild images</a></li>
</ol>

<p>Congratulations to all researchers for their outstanding contributions and achievements! 🎉👏</p>

<hr />

<p>📸✨ 我們很榮幸與大家分享，研究團隊共有 <strong>五篇論文</strong> 於 <strong>IEEE International Conference on Image Processing (ICIP) 2026</strong> 發表，展現我們在影像處理、影片編輯、遙測影像及 3D 視覺等領域的最新研究成果！</p>

<p>本次發表的研究成果包括：</p>

<ol>
  <li><a href="https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/11630121">ADAPT: Any-codec Diffusion-based Adaptation for Image Perception-Distortion Tradeoff</a></li>
  <li><a href="https://arxiv.org/html/2606.22042v1">IDAG-Edit: Multi-Object Video Editing via Instance-Decoupled Attention and Guidance</a></li>
  <li><a href="https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/11630128">PaTSeg: A Patch-Level Text Supervision Paradigm for Mask-Free Remote Sensing Segmentation</a></li>
  <li><a href="https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/11630578">TEXT-PILOT: Intelligent Visual Text Planning and Manipulation via Multi-Modal LLM as Agent</a></li>
  <li><a href="https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/11629888">Multi-Light Relightable Gaussian Splatting with Phong Reflectance from in-the-wild images</a></li>
</ol>

<p>恭喜所有參與研究的團隊成員，感謝大家的努力與貢獻！🎉👏</p>

